 "stimulus_html": "Use the summary of ranked ballots below  to find the winner and determine whether the Condorcet criterion is satisfied when each of the following voting methods are used. Recall that Option A is a Condorcet candidate.\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Votes</th>\n<th>3</th>\n<th>2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option A</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option C</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 545740,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Plurality",
